error SEM3212 testdata/golden/sema/invalid/on_anchored_send_float_not_given_away.sg:10:53 an anchored `send` of `float` must give a captured binding away: the ring takes the value's only reference and the receiving shard may already hold it before this block ends, so the block cannot keep a reference of its own, and it cannot take a fresh one here either (a parked send re-enters the block from the top and would take it again)
